# AmberCell honeypot sshd — lab/containment only.
Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
Protocol 2

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
MaxAuthTries 6
LogLevel VERBOSE

Subsystem sftp internal-sftp

Match User admin,support,lure
    ForceCommand /usr/local/bin/amber-shell.sh
    X11Forwarding no
    AllowTcpForwarding no
